# Build context for the backup image is the repo root (ops/backup/Dockerfile, 06 section 6).
# Everything is excluded except what that image copies, which keeps .env, target/, node_modules/
# and .git out of the context. Backend builds use backend/ as context with backend/.dockerignore.
*
!ops/backup/backup.sh
!ops/db/checks/size.sql
!backend/certs/
